From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.it>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 16:28:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 07/69] dt-bindings: pinctrl: qcom: Add SM7250 TLMM

Document the Top Level Mode Multiplexer of the SM7250 (lito) SoC: three
tiles (south, west, east), 146 GPIOs plus ufs_reset (exposed as GPIO 146,
as on SM8250/SM8350) and the sdc1/sdc2 pads.

The schema was produced by a generator script (tools/gen_pinctrl_sm7250.py,
not part of this tree) from the downstream pinctrl-lito.c and the live
devicetree of the phone. Validated with dt_binding_check.

This patch was generated by an AI coding assistant (Claude Opus 5.5 in
Claude Code) during an interactive bring-up session on a Motorola Moto G
5G Plus (XT2075-3, "nairo"). It has not yet been reviewed line by line
by a human and needs that review before any submission.

Assisted-by: LLM dtschema
